  "stem": "A block of mass 0.1 kg is connected to an elastic spring of spring constant 640 N/m and oscillates in a damping medium of damping constant 10<sup>–2</sup> kg/s. The system dissipates its energy gradually. The time taken for its mechanical energy of vibration to drop to half of its initial value, is closest to:",
  "options": {
    "A": "2 s",
    "B": "5 s",
    "C": "7 s",
    "D": "3.5 s"
  },
